  (text "REFP/REFN return to the same local excitation star as the cell connector supplies (Kelvin routing).\nEach ADC multiplexes two cells; readings have separate timestamps. Do not claim simultaneous sampling.\n1k + 1k / 10n differential filters are initial values. Bridge impedance, settling and noise require bench validation.\nExact full-bridge load cell, excitation current, connector and overload mounting stops remain selection tasks."
